 =\frac{1}{h}\int_{-\infty}^{\infty}dp
             \int_{-\infty}^{\infty}dx\,
 e^{-\beta p^2/(2m)}
 e^{-\beta\kappa x^2/2}.$ 因子$1/h$使一维经典配分函数无量纲。它在板书计算中被略去，因为它与$\beta$无关，不可能影响平均能量。

p.src:
For the momentum integral, set $q=\sqrt{\frac{\beta}{2m}}\,p,
 \qquad
 dp=\sqrt{\frac{2m}{\beta}}\,dq.$ For the position integral, set $y=\sqrt{\frac{\beta\kappa}{2}}\,x,
 \qquad
 dx=\sqrt{\frac{2}{\beta\kappa}}\,dy.$ Since $\int_{-\infty}^{\infty}e^{-u^2}\,du=\sqrt{\pi}$, the unnormalized phase-space integral used on the board is $\int dp\,dx\,e^{-\beta H}
 =\frac{2\pi}{\beta}\sqrt{\frac{m}{\kappa}}
 =\frac{2\pi}{\beta\omega}.$ With the phase-space cell restored, $Z_{\rm cl}=\frac{2\pi}{h\beta\omega}
           =\frac{1}{\beta\hbar\omega}.$

